+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: modular Gaussian elimination recovers the hyperplane normal "
+        "in O(d^3); at shipping d=48 over GF(257) it averaged 16,602 exact "
+        "field operations and 0.0008 seconds, while the cyclic inverse route "
